{"steam_appid":1289340,"steam_name":"TasteMaker","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1289340/559023/0de4d586bd3c05cb2605d97daf107575740cc1c1/1750668762/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1681822048","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256941836/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1681822048","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/ss_1b6614a83663b0346d2e207fa28a958d3ebb268f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1727452600","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/ss_1c452e18ea71b1f97d6964d3cabdbc81c983bd99.1920x1080.jpg?t=1727452600","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/ss_423d841c4967b7e49344eb8e842b5b02addb4378.1920x1080.jpg?t=1727452600","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/ss_10af876c76122109629039dac81071a713cc87a6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1727452600","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/ss_c26088de5239880c30e8f4eb1adf77133aea772d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1727452600"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build A Restaurant</strong></h2><br>Start with a small plot of land and build your restaurant from the ground up. Once you have made enough money, you can buy more land and expand. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/extras/175f6a730e573e69c484b1effff7aff1.poster.avif?t=1727452600\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/extras/175f6a730e573e69c484b1effff7aff1.webm?t=1727452600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/extras/175f6a730e573e69c484b1effff7aff1.mp4?t=1727452600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make It Beautiful</strong></h2><br>Guests want more than just good food - they care about your restaurant decor too. Make sure your restaurant is well decorated to keep them happy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/extras/3d2c69df06217ef103a20a2f4d76bd17.poster.avif?t=1727452600\" width=614 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/extras/3d2c69df06217ef103a20a2f4d76bd17.webm?t=1727452600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/extras/3d2c69df06217ef103a20a2f4d76bd17.mp4?t=1727452600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Employees</strong></h2><br>A good team is the core of every successful business. Hire the right employees and set their priorities wisely. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/extras/cceb1ceaf8ee07e0ab11fe5d3e74ec8f.poster.avif?t=1727452600\" width=614 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/extras/cceb1ceaf8ee07e0ab11fe5d3e74ec8f.webm?t=1727452600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/extras/cceb1ceaf8ee07e0ab11fe5d3e74ec8f.mp4?t=1727452600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep It Clean</strong></h2><br>It’s important to keep your restaurant clean. Guests will not be thrilled about the presence of rats.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/extras/1ae4ba808ee3442358d6e124519a726d.poster.avif?t=1727452600\" width=614 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/extras/1ae4ba808ee3442358d6e124519a726d.webm?t=1727452600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/extras/1ae4ba808ee3442358d6e124519a726d.mp4?t=1727452600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand The Menu</strong></h2><br>Creating a menu seems simple, but a poorly thought-out menu is the death of many restaurants. Pick your dishes carefully and make sure they are the right price.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/extras/5ca1189cca63c12825b07972572b52dd.poster.avif?t=1727452600\" width=614 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/extras/5ca1189cca63c12825b07972572b52dd.webm?t=1727452600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/extras/5ca1189cca63c12825b07972572b52dd.mp4?t=1727452600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customer Is King</strong></h2><br>Make sure customers are satisfied by meeting all their needs. Don’t leave them waiting too long, have plenty of restrooms, serve high quality food, and more. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/extras/3d6ea53dc2d59bd3da83b439567a4082.poster.avif?t=1727452600\" width=614 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/extras/3d6ea53dc2d59bd3da83b439567a4082.webm?t=1727452600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/extras/3d6ea53dc2d59bd3da83b439567a4082.mp4?t=1727452600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beat The Scenarios</strong></h2><br>TasteMaker contains six scenarios that offer unique challenges. Do you have what it takes to succeed?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/extras/e84da8c11122b9c003092ed042c5ea67.poster.avif?t=1727452600\" width=614 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/extras/e84da8c11122b9c003092ed042c5ea67.webm?t=1727452600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289340/extras/e84da8c11122b9c003092ed042c5ea67.mp4?t=1727452600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-5010U 2.10 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 5500<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Jelle Booij"],"publishers":["Jelle Booij"],"release_date":"21 Apr, 2023"}